## Requirements

- JDK 17 or newer
- Android Studio (for Android)
- Xcode 16+ and [XcodeGen](https://github.com/yonaskolb/XcodeGen) (for iOS)

## Run Android

```bash
./gradlew :androidApp:assembleDebug
# or open the project in Android Studio and run the `androidApp` configuration
```

## Run iOS

```bash
cd iosApp
xcodegen generate
open iosApp.xcodeproj
```

The `project.yml` builds the shared Kotlin framework automatically before Xcode
compiles the Swift app.

